          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "9C27AA88C6C612A0",
      "text": "¡El examen de gimnasio que proponemos aquí\\nconsiste en un [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]ejercicio[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] muy especial!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "9C27AB88C6C61453",
      "text": "Para ganarte el aprobado, vas a tener que hacer\\nfrente al [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]ejercicio emocional[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] diseñado por Tuli,\\r\\nnuestra líder.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "9C27B088C6C61CD2",
      "text": "Si tienes alguna duda, sal al área de ejercicio.\\nLa chica del chándal negro te dirá lo que hacer.\\c\\nEstá justo a la izquierda del gimnasio, según\\nsales por la puerta.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "392AC325B77CF72F",
      "text": "¡Ey, novatill[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa! ¿Qué tal te va la vida?\\nBienvenid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa al ejercicio emocional.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "392AC425B77CF8E2",
      "text": "En fin, supongo que te estarás preguntando:\\n\"¿Qué se le ha perdido a la profe de Combate\\r\\nen este gimnasio? ¿Trabaja de instructora?\".[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "392AC525B77CFA95",
      "text": "A ver cómo te lo explico... Resulta que Tuli y yo\\nsomos amigas desde que éramos un par de crías.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_25",
      "hash64": "3931D325B783310D",
      "text": "Bueno, pues, antes de nuestro último combate,\\nquedamos en que la ganadora podría pedirle lo\\r\\nque quisiera a la perdedora... ¡Cualquier favor!\\c\\nUna cosa llevó a la otra, y... mrñm...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 185,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_26",
      "hash64": "3931D025B7832BF4",
      "text": "¡Bah! En resumen, que ahora le echo una mano\\ncon el gimnasio entre clase y clase.\\c\\nAl menos es una excusa perfecta para ejercitar\\nlos músculos.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "392ABE25B77CEEB0",
      "text": "Las instrucciones de este ejercicio son pan\\ncomido, así que no te preocupes.\\c\\nPresta atención a los movimientos e imítalos,\\n¿vale? Eso es lo único que tienes que hacer.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 170,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "392ABF25B77CF063",
      "text": "Comenzamos entonces el examen de gimnasio.\\n¿Te sientes preparad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa física y mentalmente?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "392AC025B77CF216",
      "text": "¡¡Vamos a exprimir al máximo tus emociones!!\\nVenga, ¡a hacer ejercicio![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "392AC125B77CF3C9",
      "text": "¡Je! Para hacer las cosas mal, mejor no hacerlas.\\nAvísame cuando estés list[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, entonces.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "392ACA25B77D0314",
      "text": "¡Je! ¿Será que tienes un talento innato para esto?\\c\\nTu[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s Pokémon y tú formáis un equipo brillante,\\n¡y no lo digo por el sudor![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_27",
      "hash64": "3931D125B7832DA7",
      "text": "Oye, ¡te ha quedado de 10! Tienes una cara tan\\nexpresiva que me has sacado una sonrisa y todo.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_09",
      "hash64": "392ACB25B77D04C7",
      "text": "¿Qué te ha parecido el calentamiento? Porque\\nahora toca hacer trabajar a tope los músculos\\r\\ncon un combate Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_battle_a_01",
      "hash64": "7BAAA2FB34884DBA",
      "text": "No te quedes ahí parad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa como en un combate\\nnormal... ¡Quiero verte mover el esqueleto!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_10",
      "hash64": "392E4825B7800F05",
      "text": "¡Buen trabajo! No sé quién está más motivado,\\nsi tu[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s Pokémon o tus músculos.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_11",
      "hash64": "392E4725B7800D52",
      "text": "No me digas que empiezan a fallarte las fuerzas.\\nTranquil[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, que cada vez queda menos.\\c\\n¡A por la segunda fase del ejercicio, vamos![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_12",
      "hash64": "392E4625B7800B9F",
      "text": "Qué manera de sudar... Cuántas emociones a flor\\nde piel... ¡Ha sido un ejercicio espectacular![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_28",
      "hash64": "3931C625B7831AF6",
      "text": "¡Lo has hecho perfecto! Quien nos viera no sabría\\ndecir quién es la profe y quién [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]ella alumn[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_24",
      "hash64": "3931D225B7832F5A",
      "text": "Y, para terminar por todo lo alto, ¿qué tal un\\ncombate Pokémon? ¡Que no decaiga la cosa!\\r\\n¡Supera tus límites y controla el ácido láctico![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_battle_b_01",
      "hash64": "D4DF63147BD9742D",
      "text": "¡Mi objetivo es ganar fuerza y músculo!\\n¿Tienes algún consejo?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_13",
      "hash64": "392E4525B78009EC",
      "text": "¡Y con esto termina el ejercicio! ¡Buen trabajo![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_14",
      "hash64": "392E4425B7800839",
      "text": "Como ya te imaginarás, has aprobado de sobra.\\n¡Felicidades![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_15",
      "hash64": "392E4325B7800686",
      "text": "Venga, márcate una carrera hasta recepción.\\c\\nTienes que comunicar tu resultado para que el\\naprobado sea oficial.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_16",
      "hash64": "392E4225B78004D3",
      "text": "Vaya, qué lástima... Te veo muy verde aún para\\nafrontar el gimnasio de tipo Psíquico, ¿eh?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_17",
      "hash64": "392E4125B7800320",
      "text": "Si crees que aún es pronto para tirar la toalla,\\nte estaré esperando. ¡Muéstrame tu entusiasmo![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
